{"id":"wb-6-55","name":"城山子山城","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T12:17:40+00:00","status":"ready","title":"城山子山城","text":"城山子山城是渤海国的早期都城，遗址位于中国吉林省敦化市西南。\n\n城山子山城分内外二城，城垣版筑。外城东西400米，南北200米，东墙已毁。内城正方形，边长80米，位于外城中偏西，外建护城壕。地势高于外城。内外城南门相对，向西南有通往扶余府（今农安）的道路。","shortened":true,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%9F%8E%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B1%B1%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":88075000,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88075000","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与所在地一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/3145327c906defda85c4b14e.jpg","title":"敦化东牟山(城山子山城) - panoramio.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%95%A6%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%9C%E7%89%9F%E5%B1%B1(%E5%9F%8E%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B1%B1%E5%9F%8E)_-_panoramio.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/8e/%E6%95%A6%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%9C%E7%89%9F%E5%B1%B1%28%E5%9F%8E%E5%B1%B1%E5%AD%90%E5%B1%B1%E5%9F%8E%29_-_panoramio.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"冥想","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","caption":"敦化东牟山(城山子山城)","width":320,"height":240,"matchEvidence":"对应 Wikidata P373 专属相册：Chengshanzi shancheng","categorySourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Category:Chengshanzi_shancheng"},"textScope":"body-excerpt"}